OL,3,GNEWSABar hopping makes Brighton's
OL,4,Anightlife 'best in UK'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Brighton pub owner says the city's
OL,7,Fnight life has "everything going for
OL,8,Fit" after it was recognised as the best
OL,9,Fin the UK, according to a recent
OL,10,Fsurvey.
OL,12,FBrighton was named as the best city for
OL,13,Fnightlife in the UK by Time Out
OL,14,Fmagazine, and eighth best in the world
OL,15,Fahead of cities such as Amsterdam and
OL,16,FBeijing.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
