OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABar hopping makes Brighton's
OL,4,Anightlife 'best in UK'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorge Taylor, of the Prince Albert pub
OL,7,Fin Trafalgar Street, said the size of
OL,8,Fthe city "really helps its charm", as
OL,9,Fthe survey found people favoured being
OL,10,Fable to hop between establishments,
OL,11,Frather than staying in one place for
OL,12,Fthe night.
OL,14,FTaylor told BBC Radio Sussex: "The
OL,15,Foffering and diversity here is really,
OL,16,Freally up there."
